Subject: [PATCH 203/260] [ae-patch] Show a session's title for a bare session
 link in chat

A link to another session whose text is the URL itself reads as that session's title, looked up once per id and cached, with a short 'session <id>' label while it loads or when the lookup fails. Explicit [text](url) links keep their text.
